The situation is very difficult indeed;
I have reached a point where I cannot prove myself.
You say this is a frame-up, okay, then you can explain who will frame you? And why should I frame you?
Just because you have some martial arts talent?
Even Chu Yuan felt a little heavy at this moment;
If he is really identified as the murderer of Li Chen, it will be over
No matter how talented a martial artist is, if he is cruel and vicious, bullies the weak, and ignores the rules, he will still be punished;
If I train you, will it make the Qin people uncomfortable?
There is indispensable friction between warriors, and they are allowed to fight each other, but that is after entering the inner breath realm!
Before entering the Inner Information Realm, you can apply to your department for a death duel!
Only private killings are not allowed!
What's more, they are only high school seniors, not even formal warriors, and attacking ordinary people is even more sinful!
Fortunately, Qida's attitude gave him some peace of mind. At least the principal was on his side;
As the principal of Chenyang No. 1 Middle School and a fifth-level warrior, his opinions are very weighty.
"Not many people know about the grievances between you and Li Chen. It was only when you attacked Li Chen yesterday that people in the school knew about it;
Before the news had time to circulate, the other party chose to take action that night. In fact, the scope of the real culprit was very small, and he could basically be located within the school. "
Chu Yuan nodded and agreed with this view;
Moreover, because Li Chen has bodyguards from the Inner Breath Realm around him, the students can basically rule out suspicion;
Even most teachers can rule out suspicion. They don't have the ability to quickly kill the inner breath realm.
There is another question that I can’t figure out clearly: What is the other party planning?
Taking it out on yourself?
that's impossible
"I will start the investigation. You should also pay attention to the abnormalities around you." Qi Da put out the cigarette butt. "This kind of thing cannot be rushed. I can still stop the Public Security Bureau and the Li family for a few days;
Since the real murderer dared to take the risk of offending the Li family, he would definitely not just kill someone. "
"Okay."
"Are the martial arts elixirs enough?"
"It's not enough."
"You're welcome." Qi Da smiled, then took out a few jade bottles from somewhere and placed them on the table;
"You can't fall behind in your cultivation, just go ahead."
"Thank you, principal."
After taking the elixir, Chu Yuan did not go back to the classroom, but went home directly;
Chu Ying was at school, but Han Cui was at home.
She had already listened to Chu Yuan and closed the restaurant, preparing to transfer the store;
It’s just that I haven’t left home for a while.
Seeing Chu Yuan suddenly return, Han Cui was a little surprised and asked a few questions;
Chu Yuan dealt with it casually and locked himself in the bedroom.
Qida is right, no matter what happens, cultivation is the most important thing!
His current cultivation level is already at the seventh level of Qi training, and he can reach the foundation building stage after completing the ninth level!
If there is no shortage of elixirs, it does not take long to reach the ninth level.
After practicing until night, all the immortal cultivator pills on hand were consumed, and Chu Yuan opened his eyes;
He picked up the terminal and there were several messages from Yang Yi, asking why he was not in school today and whether he should continue the transaction.
Chu Yuan didn't care so much and asked directly, "Send me Zhou Zhe's address."
